WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.560
The Avengers have one job: to protect people.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.500
The actors that play the Avengers have an
even harder job, though: protecting the secrets

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.460
of the next big Marvel blockbuster.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.280
And some of them are better at it than others.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.299
So it's a good thing the fate of the world
doesn't depend on their silence, because otherwise

00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:20.619
Earth would be doomed thanks to these Marvel
actors who revealed big spoilers about Avengers

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:21.619
4.

00:00:21.619 --> 00:00:23.899
Sebastian Stan spills secrets

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:28.499
It may seem like every character in the MCU
appeared in Avengers: Infinity War, but according

00:00:28.499 --> 00:00:34.350
to the Winter Soldier himself, Sebastian Stan,
the cast of the sequel will be even more stacked.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.350
Stan told The Independent,

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:39.219
"There was one scene, I think, we had where
everybody was there.

00:00:39.219 --> 00:00:42.469
It took them three months in planning this
scene to have everyone there.

00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:46.679
You look around and you just saw everyone
from Samuel L. Jackson to Michael Douglas

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.269
to Michelle Pfeiffer.

00:00:48.269 --> 00:00:49.269
Everybody was there."

00:00:49.269 --> 00:00:54.109
Considering Stan, Jackson, Douglas, and Pfeiffer
were all turned to dust by Thanos in Avengers:

00:00:54.109 --> 00:00:58.510
Infinity War and the Ant-Man and the Wasp
post-credits scene, this might be the biggest

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:02.929
spoiler of them all, as it implies they'll
all be brought back to life.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.110
Hmm!

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.390
Zoe Saldana slips up

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:10.850
The official title of Avengers 4 has been
kept tightly under wraps, with Marvel Studios

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:15.340
head Kevin Feige suggesting that it's actually
a spoiler for Infinity War.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.729
However, some fans thought they had gotten
the scoop when Zoe Saldana told a reporter,

00:01:19.729 --> 00:01:23.460
"I think that the Guardians just shot their
part when it comes to Infinity War like the

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.820
first part, and we all have to go back for
Gauntlet later this year."

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:31.030
Guardians of the Galaxy director James Gunn
later said that Saldana misspoke, and that

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:33.659
the title isn't Infinity Gauntlet at all.

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:38.560
Whatever the case, Feige told IGN he regrets
making such a big deal about it to begin with.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.610
"It's gotten entirely out of hand.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:44.700
And now will have no chance to living up to
any expectations of what it's gonna be.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:49.570
And it sort of backfired, if I'm honest with
you, because the notion was to not talk about

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.789
it so the focus was to be on [Infinity War]."

00:01:52.789 --> 00:01:55.000
Drax deflates death

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.939
Almost all of the Guardians of the Galaxy
were lost at the end of Avengers: Infinity

00:01:58.939 --> 00:01:59.939
War.

00:01:59.939 --> 00:02:01.079
But will they stay dead?

00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:05.940
Former Guardians director James Gunn had said
he planned to conclude the team's storyline

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:10.390
in Guardians of the Galaxy Volume 3; he has
since been fired, but it still seems reasonable

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:14.600
to assume that a lot of them will make their
way back from the dead in the fourth film.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:19.250
Star Dave Bautista seemingly confirmed that
his Drax the Destroyer will be one of those

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.490
people, saying in an interview with Collider,

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:26.410
"[After Avengers: Infinity War] I got a lot
of texts saying, 'I can't believe you're dead,

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:27.520
your character is dead.'

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:31.400
They were really like heartbroken and I was
like, 'I'm gonna be in [Avengers] 4.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.050
I'm gonna be in Guardians 3.'

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:37.880
I don't know how they're bringing me back,
yeah, but somehow I'm going to make it because,

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:42.660
as far as I know, I am going to be in Guardians
3, so I have to be back."

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:47.110
This was also seemingly confirmed by Chris
Pratt, who said in an instagram post that

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:51.870
he "Can’t wait to start shooting Guardians
Volume 3" with co-star Pom Klementieff.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:56.980
Considering both of their characters, Star-Lord
and Mantis, also bit the dust alongside Drax

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:01.980
in Avengers: Infinity War, it certainly seems
some sort of mass resurrection is in store

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:04.280
for the Guardians of the Galaxy.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.220
Thanos snaps back

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:11.410
Josh Brolin's Thanos did away with most of
the MCU's heroes in Infinity War, but the

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:15.030
post-credits scene for the film hinted that
there was still hope for the universe in the

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:20.220
form of Brie Larson's Captain Marvel, who
will be introduced in her own 1990s-set standalone

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.600
film before joining the rest of the gang for
Avengers 4.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:27.540
Although we've known for a while that Captain
Marvel will appear, Brolin appeared to drop

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:31.720
at least a bit of a spoiler when he said that
he shared a scene with Larson, hinting that

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:35.350
Thanos will have a head to head confrontation
with her Carol Danvers.

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:41.000
Brolin also revealed that Black Widow, War
Machine, Thor, Captain America, and Iron Man

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.230
were present, which is notable since those
characters were all among the few survivors

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:47.920
at the end of Infinity War.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:49.290
Stark Jr.?

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:53.570
Gwyneth Paltrow's appearance in Infinity War
hinted at a happy future for Tony Stark and

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:57.570
Pepper Potts, with Tony suggesting that the
pair could soon start a family.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:01.940
Paltrow, though, revealed even more in an
interview with the Official Avengers: Infinity

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:07.690
War magazine, suggesting that that dream will
actually come to fruition in Avengers 4, saying,

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:10.380
"Pepper and Tony have had a real long journey
together.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:15.260
She obviously starts as his dutiful assistant,
and then the relationship evolves, and now

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:18.549
this decade later they're married, and they
have a child.

00:04:18.549 --> 00:04:24.080
Their relationship has evolved in all of the
ways that great romances evolve."

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.949
Can't keep a good Mackie down

00:04:25.949 --> 00:04:30.500
Falcon didn't make it through the end of Infinity
War, but Anthony Mackie may have inadvertently

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.889
revealed that he'll return from the great
beyond.

00:04:32.889 --> 00:04:38.330
In December, 2017, the star tweeted a photo
of himself from the set of Avengers 4, saying,

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:41.560
"Sometimes you have to sit back and marvel
at where you are."

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:46.020
And sometimes you have to just celebrate being
alive… again.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:48.009
Heimdalls and Heimdon'ts

00:04:48.009 --> 00:04:52.020
Although a lot of characters seem to be making
their way back for Avengers 4, at least one

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.349
apparently won't be.

00:04:53.349 --> 00:04:58.150
Idris Elba, whose character Heimdall was killed
at the start of Avengers 4, revealed on his

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:02.900
Twitter account that he would not be coming
back, writing "#SpoilerAlert Gonna miss my

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:03.900
guy."

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:04.700
Hey.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:05.560
At least he put a spoiler tag on it!

